//! Port of `packages/server/src/api/trust.ts`.
//!
//! The `links` and `root` groups are ported (kernel B); the `trust` group and the helpers below it are a SKELETON (generated by `crates/server/tools/gen-skeleton.mjs`)
//! whose items return `NOT_IMPLEMENTED` (501) until ported. Port the bodies from the TypeScript source line by line (see
//! crates/PORTING.md); keep the signatures, which other modules call.
#![allow(
    unused_variables,
    unused_imports,
    dead_code,
    clippy::too_many_arguments,
    clippy::module_inception
)]

